window.products.push({"id":862013,"name":"VonShef Ice Cream, Frozen Yogurt and Sorbet Maker Machine 1.5-QT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JEVukJH7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the VonShef Ice Cream Maker you can create delicious frozen ice cream, yogurts, sherbet, sorbets and gelato at home. Add anything from fruit to herbs, chocolate to nuts or seeds to make a frozen dessert you will truly enjoy!The versatile VonShef Ice Cream Maker was voted as one of the Great British Food Magazine’s Top Five Ice Cream Makers on the market! and it is easy to see why. Now available in the US and produced to US voltage, you can experiment with decadent combinations of ingredients or even just throw in a handful of your favorite candy. In 15-25 minutes you could be enjoying your ice cream or sherbet creations.Whether you want to create luscious ice cream or fat free frozen yogurt, sherbet, gelato or sorbet, the VonShef Ice Cream Maker will help satisfy your sweet tooth all year round and you will know exactly what has been added, because you decide on the ingredients.It is very easy to use too. Simply freeze the quick freeze bowl beforehand, add whatever ingredients you desire and start the motor. This will prevent ice crystals from forming, ensuring your ice cream is soft and deliciously creamy. You’ll hardly know the motor is running because it produces just 65 decibels of noise, which is roughly equivalent to the noise level of an everyday conversation.Features• Removable double isolation bowl• Large 1.5-Quart capacity• Extra Large Ingredient Funnel• Detachable accessories for easy cleaning• Anti skid rubber on bottom of the unit• Motor with left and right motion• Reversible thermostat built in the unit• Unit size:￠8\" H:9.8\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JEVukJH7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VonShef","source_asin":"B00NEK6L6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NEK6L6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NEK6L6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
