window.products.push({"id":862167,"name":"Laura Ashley 2x3 Silver Flat Metal Picture Frame (Vertical) with Pull-Out Easel Stand, Made for Tabletop, Counterspace, Shelf and Desk (2x3, Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516pR21tG3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LAURA ASHLEY BRINGS PHOTOS TO LIFE: Frames aren’t just for displaying your photos- they serve as essential home décor pieces that can transform any room into the soothing and beautiful living spaces that fill us with warmth throughout the seasons. This Laura Ashley frame is a wonderful choice to display your precious memories. This classic design makes the frame a brilliant addition to any room in your home, while complimenting any shelf, cabinet, coffee table or desk that it rests on. ELEGANT DESIGN: The sleek, silver edges that surround the glass panes create the feeling of understated elegance. This eye-catching metal frame reflects light in a subtle way that brightens up any interior space. The sturdiness of the swinging easel allows the frame to rest solidly on any countertop in your home. The narrow design of this gorgeous frame gives off an alluring quality that captures the beauty in your favorite 2” x 3” portrait shots, cityscape photos, and fun family snaps. EASY TO USE: The solid design of this narrow metal frame and easel make it easy to move from room to room. Simply pull out the easel to stand it on any flat surface. To replace a photo or small 2” x 3” print inside- remove the clear sticker and gently push the glass pane away from the front of the frame. Slide the glass pane up from the bottom of the frame. [NOTES: (1) This Frame Can Not Be Mounted on a Wall! (2) This Vertical Frame Does Not Stand Horizontally!] SOPHISTICATED DISPLAY: Whether it is perched attractively on a windowsill or serving as a sharp-looking addition on top of your accent cabinet, this modern frame turns wallet-size, family photos into timeless treasures. The charming, flat metal frame makes a wonderful choice for display frames at wedding receptions and other special events. Your small photo prints, favorite poems, and illustrations will stand out in a huge way when displayed in these chic frames. GIFT POTENTIAL: Once you see how well this radiant metal frame elevates the look of the room you place it in, you may want to add a companion frame to join it on the desk or mantlepiece. This attractive frame is also a thoughtful gift that will personalize the decor of any room and any interior space. Your Mom, grandmother, sister, friends, and co-workers will share in the joy of displaying their wallet-size photos in style in these beautiful flat-metal frames.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516pR21tG3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B0842YG27M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842YG27M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842YG27M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
