window.products.push({"id":862232,"name":"Welsh Love Spoon - Dainty Double Heart in Rosewood (EH3R)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xScazWt4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Welsh Love Spoon is one of the few romantic objects that have been passed down from the early ages. The craft of Love Spoon making is a branch of woodcarving called whittling. The woodcarver was the professional; the whittler was the amateur. Woodcarving goes back into early history. These beautiful hand crafted lovespoons originated by Elwyn Hughes. His work was so admired that his hobby became his business. His passion for welsh love spoon making is reflected in these love spoons. Available in Rosewood, Walnut or Yew.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xScazWt4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welsh Love Spoons","source_asin":"B00EFZVKS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EFZVKS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EFZVKS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
