window.products.push({"id":862269,"name":"Silicone Cooking Utensil Set, 15 PCS Premium Kitchen Utensils Spatula Set with Wooden Handle for Cooking and Baking-Heat Resistant & BPA Free-Best Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AQzRgGvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"-🍓Have You Searching For Useful Kitchen Utensils to Meet Your Various Cooking Needs? -🍓Have You Worried About Other Metal Cooking Utensils Scratching Your Pots And Pans? Our 15 PCS Premium Silicone Kitchen Cooking Utensils Set with Holder will satisfy your various needs! --Made of 100% BPA-free, FOOD GRADE Silicone and Natural Wooden Handles. Great for frying, baking, whisking, mixing, stirring and cooking. Hanging Hole and utensils holder useful for hanging and storage, let your kitchen tidy. Exquisite craft, beautiful appearance very suitable for new home, birthday, wedding, housewarming, thanksgiving, Christmas or any occasions. 💐💐What Makes Our Silicone Kitchen Tools Different? ✅Food-grade Silicone -100% BPA-free, high quality silicone, Non toxic, Non smell, healthy for daily use. ✅Heat Resistant -Heat resistant up from -22° to 446°F, will not not produce any hazardous fumes. ✅Sturdy and Durable -Anti-rust, Anti-bacteria, Anti-deformation, can be used for many years. ✅Comfortable To Hold -The ergonomic handle allows you to enjoy the cooking process more. ✅Advanced Soft Silicone -Soft silicone head can protect your other expensive kitchen gadgets from scratches. ✅Easy to Clean and Store -Non-stick attributes make it easy to clean up by hands in warm water, hanging hole and utensils holder are convenient for store. 🍱🍱Premium Utensils Set Meet Your Various Cooking Needs🍱 √Slotted Turner√Slotted Turner√Solid Turner√Deep Soup Ladle√Pasta Server√Flexible Spatula√Spoon Spatula√Basting Brush√Egg Whisk√Peeler√Slotted Spoon√Solid Spoon√Kitchen Tongs√Slotted Spoon√Utensil Holder 😃👍Customer Warranty:😃 If you have any questions about our products, welcome to contact us. We will try our best to make each customer 100% satisfied!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AQzRgGvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Footek","source_asin":"B093C4PC72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093C4PC72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093C4PC72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":862270,"name":"Extremus Deluge Sports Water Bottle, Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle,Thermos with 100% Leak-Proof Travel Lid, w/Paracord Survival Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGDs+KkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEY FEATURES – Triple insulated vacuum sealed double wall – 100% leak proof – BPA-Free – Paracord Survival handle – Heavy duty 550lb carabiner – Dishwasher safe (SOLID COLORS ONLY) – Available in American born Prym1 patterns TRIPLE-INSULATED – The Extremus Deluge Stainless steel sports bottles have a 3.5mm vacuum space, sealed by double walls of food grade 304 stainless steel with a layer of copper coating to insulate hot or cold beverages from the outer surface. This superior triple-insulated design helps to preserve hot beverages up to 12 hours or cold beverages up to 24 hours. Great as a travel mug! 100% LEAK PROOF BPA-FREE LID – The wide mouth screw on cap with integrated smaller screw on drinking cap is ideal for hot or cold liquids and is 100% leak proof. Our wide mouth water bottle cap provides plenty of access for no-hassle cleaning and the tethered smaller drinking cap means no more lost water bottle caps. The Deluge cap is molded with safe non-toxic BPA-free material for exceptional durability. PARACORD SURVIVAL HANDLE – The Deluge includes a removable survival paracord handle and a heavy duty 550lb carabiner. The Extremus paracord has a tensile strength of 550lbs, making Deluge the ideal sports bottle for not only the gym and everyday use but also unexpected survival situations. DISHWASHER SAFE (SOLID COLORS ONLY) – The Extremus Deluge wide mouth sports bottle is easy to keep clean by hand, and the solid color bottles are also dishwasher safe. Be sure to wash the Deluge before initial use. For a thorough cleaning, remove gasket and seals from the lid and hand wash with a mild dish soap and warm water. Stay hydrated no matter where you go with the Extremus Deluge sports bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGDs+KkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Extremus","source_asin":"B092DR6MLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092DR6MLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092DR6MLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
