window.products.push({"id":862587,"name":"Grab Bar Specialists Heavy Shower Curtain - Weighted Water Barrier for Curb-Free Shower Threshold/Use with Shower Dam / 3-Ply Textured Vinyl/White / 7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518otqrJMoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chain-Weighted Shower Curtain by Grab Bar Specialists is tough, durable and industrial strength. Three layers of textured vinyl create a heavy-duty, commercial-quality shower curtain used by top hospitals, nursing homes, college dormitories and other institutions. Commercial-quality shower curtains are installed in showers which are used by multiple people such as fitness centers and locker rooms - often before the area can completely dry. Our commercial-grade shower curtains are made of a heavy-duty, three-ply vinyl with a special coating. FEATURES: Heavy-duty, commercial-quality, tri-ply vinyl shower curtain. Ideal for hospitals, nursing homes and college dormitories White, textured shower curtain is industrial strength Works perfectly with curbless shower using collapsible shower water dam Weights sewn into the shower curtain bottom. Nickel-plated brass grommets are spaced every 6\" across the reinforced top of the shower curtain These commercial shower curtains last for years and have withstood intensive usage in high-traffic hospitals and college dormitories You can't find a tougher, more durable shower curtain; Resists tearing and abrasion Comes in 2 sizes: 48\" W x 72\" H 72\" W x 72\" H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518otqrJMoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grab Bar Specialists","source_asin":"B09N9STJCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N9STJCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N9STJCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":862588,"name":"DECOWALL DSH-A25GR 9.8\" Non-Ticking Silent Modern Pastel Wall Clock DIY for Living Room Bedrooms Office Kitchens (Gray, 25cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-6p1HT-gL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Decowall Wall Clock We hope your new wall clock will serve its purpose well as a time keeper. You can also decorate your plain painted wall in your home or workplace with our premium Decowall branded wall clock. Before using our wall clock, please make a note of our care advice and instructions. Instructions - Move the hands to the correct time using the adjustment wheel on the back of the wall clock mechanism. - Where the wall clock is to be mounted, please ensure that an adequate wall fixing is used to hang your wall clock, taking into account the type of wall and weight of your wall clock. Care & Caution - Please keep your Decowall wall clock out of direct sunlight as the colour of the dial and case may fade. - Please use a soft, dry cloth to clean your Decowall wall clock as the use of liquids and cleaning agents may cause cosmetic damage - Please always handle your Decowall wall clock with care. - Insert a fresh AA/LR6 battery. Old or poor quality batteries may cause your wall clock to lose time. We recommend using fresh, branded, alkaline batteries. Warranty Unless otherwise stated by the retailer, your Decowall wall clock comes with 12 months warranty. Your warranty begins from the date of purchase and covers any faults that may arise during normal intended use. Our Warranty does not cover damage, tampering, battery leakage, or any faults/defect that arise as a result of misuse. If in the unlikely event your wall clock proves defective and you need to claim against this warranty, please contact us directly with your order history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-6p1HT-gL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECOWALL","source_asin":"B0774J6BQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0774J6BQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0774J6BQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":862589,"name":"Department 56 Alpine Village The Goat Herder's Lit House, 5.91 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JFZB8IbRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country inn nestled in a quiet river town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JFZB8IbRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00AYP8S1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AYP8S1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AYP8S1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
