window.products.push({"id":862735,"name":"Bliss Collections Wine Bottle Milestone Labels, Housewarming Gifts For New Home for Celebrating Special Moments - Set of 5 Unique Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k56qD7wqL._AC_.jpg","description":"New Home Milestone wine labels are the perfect housewarming gift for a couples new home! Moving is so much work. Everyone knows it. But when you reward that hard work with celebratory wine, it makes the hassle of packing and unpacking boxes a little less annoying. Each wine label features a unique poem (see gallery images). Bliss Collections wine labels are professionally printed on a waterproof adhesive; just peel and stick. WHAT'S INCLUDED: A set of 5 unique wine labels. Each set includes a poem for: Change Of Address Complete The Boxes Are Unpacked It's Time For A Break First Dinner Guests One Year Home Anniversary HIGHEST QUALITY: Labels are printed on high quality 4”x5” waterproof adhesive. Sized to fit most standard 750 ml wine bottles. Our labels can be chilled or put on ice and the ink won’t fade or bleed. Our labels are designed to survive! INSTRUCTIONS: All wine labels are self-adhesive and prepared for quick use; just peel and stick! (Detailed instructions for removing the existing labels from your bottles and adhering the new labels are included in each set) IMPORTANT NOTES: Wine and bottles are not included. When selecting wine bottles, choose bottles that are perfectly symmetrical for the length of the label. Labels are shipped in secured packaging and arrive pre-cut and ready to apply. We provide the highest-quality prints. (300DPI & professionally printed) Labels include a small edge making it easy to remove the adhesive label from the backing paper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k56qD7wqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bliss Paper Boutique","source_asin":"B07BD527GJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BD527GJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BD527GJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
