window.products.push({"id":862803,"name":"BeeGreen Red Reusable-Grocery-Bags Bulk 20 Pack. Reusable-Shopping-Bags Extra Large for 50LBS heavy-duty Sturdy. Foldable Tote Bags Machine-Washable-P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QtUp8hO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRA LARGE CAPACITY & DURABLE: Our red reusable grocery bags are roomy to hold up to 50 Lbs or 2-3 plastic heavy duty grocery bags of stuff. Sturdy grocery bags with handles help you avoid a dreaded plastic bag breakage. All these reusable shopping bags are made of polyester which is lightweight yet sturdy and they are reinforced with bias tape which makes our grocery bags strong enough to pack large amounts of heavy groceries, like food, vegetables. Stuff them full and hardly tear. BULK IN QUANTITY & DIY GIFT: Our red reusable grocery bags are in 20 bulk pack sets. They can hold a week’s worth of groceries in 20 bags for large families, suitable for both men and women. Our shopping bags can meet groceries, outdoor activities, parties, festival usage, or DIY in a time. For example, enterprises can distribute these lightweight shopping bags to employees or give them to consumers during activities or as holiday gifts for Christmas Thanksgiving Mother's Day EASY TO FOLD & STORE: Our kitchen reusable grocery bags have easy foldable design, you can easily fold our reusable shopping bags down to about the size of your palm 5.1*5.3\" into the inner pouch, which takes up any space for storage. Reusable bags with handles allow you to go over your shoulder or in your hand, which makes carrying them into the house from the car much easier. REUSABLE: Now you won't have to use the plastic or brown paper bags at the grocery store, which are not only wasteful but also cost you money at most stores. Keep a bulk of these reusable bags in your purse or your pocket or your car for any last-minute grocery trips to help to reduce 500 plastic bags every year and be more to our common home. MACHINE WASHABLE & EASIER LIFE: Being washable is a must for any reusable bags. Our reusable grocery bags are Machine Washable! Toss them in the washing machine to save your time! When you're toting things like eggs, meat, and yogurt, accidents are bound to happen, which can lead to a sticky mess inside of your reusable grocery bags. If you have a bag that's easy to cold wash, you don't have to cry over spilled milk. This set of reusable bags is lightweight and easy to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QtUp8hO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B0B5ZK3T2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-862803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5ZK3T2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5ZK3T2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
